      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>The Rangers are devoted to fighting Sauron and his min- ions by an ancient tradition of war and strife. This obligation makes it harder for them to put their spirit at ease even when enjoying a respite from adventuring.</p><p><i>During the Fellow­ship phase you recover a maximum number of Hope points equal to half your HEART score (rounding fractions up).</i></p><p><blockquote></blockquote></p></br><p>&nbsp;</p>",
